                  <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Experiencing a single panic attack does not mean you have panic disorder. Panic disorder requires:</p>
                  <div class="space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                      <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
                      <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">Recurrent, unexpected panic attacks.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
